  "description": "PO.DAAC Virtual Data Set for OSTIA-UKMO-L4-GLOB-REP-v2.0, advertised in CMR as RelatedUrl GET DATA / VIRTUAL COLLECTION. Reference files are anonymous over TEA HTTPS (bucket listing denied); chunks need Earthdata Login. The *_virtual_https reference resolves chunks over HTTPS (bearer token, any region); the *_virtual_s3 reference resolves chunks over S3 (temporary credentials, us-west-2 only). Also published as Icechunk v2 stores (written with icechunk 2.1.2), the first DAAC Icechunk store advertised in CMR, and preferred over Kerchunk per CMR. The S3 URI in CMR is malformed (s3://archive.podaac.earthdata.nasa.gov/...); the real bucket is podaac-ops-cumulus-public.\n\nStatus (probed 2026-11-06): Production.",
